  "source": "src/main/platform/fs-path.ts",
  "note": "decode: none\narg0 is a path string a launcher adapter read (a registry value, a VDF or JSON field, an INI line), already decoded by its caller. The module is node:path on Windows, so normalize and sep are win32 (sep is a backslash). Plain values, no decode.\npathKey is normalizeLauncherPath then String.prototype.toLowerCase (full Unicode lowercase mapping, final sigma included); samePath(a, b) is pathKey(a) === pathKey(b), so the samepath-* cases give the keys test/fs-path.test.ts compares.",
